translate3d(0, 0px, 0)"><div style="opacity:1"><article class="flex gap-8 border-t border-white py-16 md:gap-12 lg:gap-[120px] lg:py-[120px]"><p class="w-[72px] shrink-0 font-normal text-[42px] leading-[48px] tracking-[-1.68px] text-bold-amber md:text-[56px] md:leading-[62px] md:tracking-[-2.24px] lg:w-[90px]">03</p><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-6"><h3 class="font-semibold text-[32px] leading-[38px] tracking-[-1.28px] text-white md:text-[40px] md:leading-[46px] md:tracking-[-1.6px]">Manufacturing</h3><p class="font-normal text-[18px] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.72px] text-white md:text-[22px] md:tracking-[-0.88px]">Our manufacturing capabilities support high-quality components, disciplined processes and renewable energy assets designed for long-lasting lifecycle performance.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="inline-flex rounded-[2px] bg-humble-beige px-2 py-1 font-medium text-[12px] uppercase leading-[12px] tracking-[-0.24px] text-ever-teal-100">Components</span><span class="inline-flex rounded-[2px] bg-humble-beige px-2 py-1 font-medium text-[12px] uppercase leading-[12px] tracking-[-0.24px] text-ever-teal-100">Quality</span><span class="inline-flex rounded-[2px] bg-humble-beige px-2 py-1 font-medium text-[12px] uppercase leading-[12px] tracking-[-0.24px] text-ever-teal-100">Scale</span></div></div></article></div></div><div class="relative w-full bg-ever-teal-100 will-change-transform" style="z-index:13;transform:translate3d(0, 0px, 0)"><div style="opacity:1"><article class="flex gap-8 border-t border-white py-16 md:gap-12 lg:gap-[120px] lg:py-[120px]"><p class="w-[72px] shrink-0 font-normal text-[42px] leading-[48px] tracking-[-1.68px] text-bold-amber md:text-[56px] md:leading-[62px] md:tracking-[-2.24px] lg:w-[90px]">04</p><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-6"><h3 class="font-semibold text-[32px] leading-[38px] tracking-[-1.28px] text-white md:text-[40px] md:leading-[46px] md:tracking-[-1.6px]">Project execution</h3><p class="font-normal text-[18px] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.72px] text-white md:text-[22px] md:tracking-[-0.88px]">We manage project delivery with focus on safety, coordination and on-ground execution across complex renewable energy environments.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="inline-flex rounded-[2px] bg-humble-beige px-2 py-1 font-medium text-[12px] uppercase leading-[12px] tracking-[-0.24px] text-ever-teal-100">Delivery</span><span class="inline-flex rounded-[2px] bg-humble-beige px-2 py-1 font-medium text-[12px] uppercase leading-[12px] tracking-[-0.24px] text-ever-teal-100">Safety</span><span class="inline-flex rounded-[2px] bg-humble-beige px-2 py-1 font-medium text-[12px] uppercase leading-[12px] tracking-[-0.24px] text-ever-teal-100">Coordination</span></div></div></article></div></div><div class="relative w-full bg-ever-teal-100 will-change-transform" style="z-index:14;transform:translate3d(0, 0px, 0)"><div style="opacity:1"><article class="flex gap-8 border-t border-white py-16 md:gap-12 lg:gap-[120px] lg:py-[120px]"><p class="w-[72px] shrink-0 font-normal text-[42px] leading-[48px] tracking-[-1.68px] text-bold-amber md:text-[56px] md:leading-[62px] md:tracking-[-2.24px] lg:w-[90px]">05</p><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-6"><h3 class="font-semibold text-[32px] leading-[38px] tracking-[-1.28px] text-white md:text-[40px] md:leading-[46px] md:tracking-[-1.6px]">Services</h3><p class="font-normal text-[18px] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.72px] text-white md:text-[22px] md:tracking-[-0.88px]">Our service teams provide complete visibility into renewable energy asset performance through operations, maintenance and lifecycle care that help improve long-term efficiency.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="inline-flex rounded-[2px] bg-humble-beige px-2 py-1 font-medium text-[12px] uppercase leading-[12px] tracking-[-0.24px] text-ever-teal-100">Operations &amp; Maintenance</span><span class="inline-flex rounded-[2px] bg-humble-beige px-2 py-1 font-medium text-[12px] uppercase leading-[12px] tracking-[-0.24px] text-ever-teal-100">Asset care</span><span class="inline-flex rounded-[2px] bg-humble-beige px-2 py-1 font-medium text-[12px] uppercase leading-[12px] tracking-[-0.24px] text-ever-teal-100">Performance</span></div></div></article></div></div><div class="relative w-full bg-ever-teal-100 will-change-transform" style="z-index:15;transform:translate3d(0, 0px, 0)"><div style="opacity:1"><article class="flex gap-8 border-t border-white py-16 md:gap-12 lg:gap-[120px] lg:py-[120px]"><p class="w-[72px] shrink-0 font-normal text-[42px] leading-[48px] tracking-[-1.68px] text-bold-amber md:text-[56px] md:leading-[62px] md:tracking-[-2.24px] lg:w-[90px]">06</p><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-6"><h3 class="font-semibold text-[32px] leading-[38px] tracking-[-1.28px] text-white md:text-[40px] md:leading-[46px] md:tracking-[-1.6px]">Partnerships</h3><p class="font-normal text-[18px] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.72px] text-white md:text-[22px] md:tracking-[-0.88px]">We work with clients and partners to create clean energy systems that stay relevant across changing business and energy realities.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="inline-flex rounded-[2px] bg-humble-beige px-2 py-1 font-medium text-[12px] uppercase leading-[12px] tracking-[-0.24px] text-ever-teal-100">Clients</span><span class="inline-flex rounded-[2px] bg-humble-beige px-2 py-1 font-medium text-[12px] uppercase leading-[12px] tracking-[-0.24px] text-ever-teal-100">Partners</span><span class="inline-flex rounded-[2px] bg-humble-beige px-2 py-1 font-medium text-[12px] uppercase leading-[12px] tracking-[-0.24px] text-ever-teal-100">Long-term value</span></div></div></article></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><div><section class="flex flex-col bg-humble-beige pt-16 gap-6 min-[900px]:gap-8 min-[1440px]:gap-12 min-[1440px]:pt-[160px]"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-4 sm:px-5 m