countries and six continents</p></div></li><li class="flex min-w-0"><div class="flex h-full w-full min-w-0 flex-col gap-4 border-b border-dark-2 pb-6"><p class="text-ever-teal-100 font-normal text-[44px] leading-[50px] tracking-[-1.76px] md:text-[52px] md:leading-[58px] md:tracking-[-2.08px] min-[1440px]:text-[56px] min-[1440px]:leading-[62px] min-[1440px]:tracking-[-2.24px]">8,500+</p><p class="text-dark-2 w-full whitespace-pre-line font-normal text-[14px] leading-[22px] tracking-[-0.28px] min-[1440px]:text-[16px] min-[1440px]:leading-[24px] min-[1440px]:tracking-[-0.32px]">Professionals driving the energy transition</p></div></li><li class="flex min-w-0"><div class="flex h-full w-full min-w-0 flex-col gap-4 border-b border-dark-2 pb-6"><p class="text-ever-teal-100 font-normal text-[44px] leading-[50px] tracking-[-1.76px] md:text-[52px] md:leading-[58px] md:tracking-[-2.08px] min-[1440px]:text-[56px] min-[1440px]:leading-[62px] min-[1440px]:tracking-[-2.24px]">1,900+</p><p class="text-dark-2 w-full whitespace-pre-line font-normal text-[14px] leading-[22px] tracking-[-0.28px] min-[1440px]:text-[16px] min-[1440px]:leading-[24px] min-[1440px]:tracking-[-0.32px]">Clients served globally</p></div></li><li class="flex min-w-0"><div class="flex h-full w-full min-w-0 flex-col gap-4 border-b border-dark-2 pb-6"><p class="text-ever-teal-100 font-normal text-[44px] leading-[50px] tracking-[-1.76px] md:text-[52px] md:leading-[58px] md:tracking-[-2.08px] min-[1440px]:text-[56px] min-[1440px]:leading-[62px] min-[1440px]:tracking-[-2.24px]"><span class="block">Global</span><span class="block">100</span></p><p class="text-dark-2 w-full whitespace-pre-line font-normal text-[14px] leading-[22px] tracking-[-0.28px] min-[1440px]:text-[16px] min-[1440px]:leading-[24px] min-[1440px]:tracking-[-0.32px]">Top 10 Most Sustainable Organisations</p></div></li></ul></div></section></div><div><section class="bg-white py-16 md:py-20 lg:py-24 min-[1440px]:py-[160px]"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-4 sm:px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-10 min-[1440px]:px-[40px] flex flex-col gap-12 lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:gap-[120px]"><h2 class="max-w-[460px] shrink-0 font-semibold text-[42px] leading-[48px] tracking-[-1.68px] text-ever-teal-100 md:text-[56px] md:leading-[62px] md:tracking-[-2.24px]">Creating<span class="text-bold-amber"> <!-- -->clean energy</span><span> <!-- -->ecosystems that stay ready for what comes next</span></h2><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-10 lg:max-w-[780px]"><p class="font-normal text-dark-2 text-[18px] leading-[28px] tracking-[-0.36px] md:text-[20px] md:tracking-[-0.4px]">Every energy need is different. Our role is to bring the right capabilities together, so clients can move from ambition to execution with a partner who understands technology, delivery and long-term asset care.</p><div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2"><article class="flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-[8px] bg-humble-beige p-8"><h3 class="font-semibold text-[30px] leading-[36px] tracking-[-1.2px] text-ever-teal-100">End-to-end solutions</h3><p class="font-normal text-dark-2 text-[16px] leading-[24px] tracking-[-0.32px]">One partner across wind, solar, storage and emerging technologies.</p></article><article class="flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-[8px] bg-humble-beige p-8"><h3 class="font-semibold text-[30px] leading-[36px] tracking-[-1.2px] text-ever-teal-100">Lifecycle asset care</h3><p class="font-normal text-dark-2 text-[16px] leading-[24px] tracking-[-0.32px]">Support across operations, maintenance and long-term performance.</p></article><article class="flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-[8px] bg-humble-beige p-8"><h3 class="font-semibold text-[30px] leading-[36px] tracking-[-1.2px] text-ever-teal-100">Global technology base</h3><p class="font-normal text-dark-2 text-[16px] leading-[24px] tracking-[-0.32px]">R&amp;D capability across Germany, Denmark, the Netherlands and India.</p></article><article class="flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-[8px] bg-humble-beige p-8"><h3 class="font-semibold text-[30px] leading-[36px] tracking-[-1.2px] text-ever-teal-100">88.51% · Reduction in Scope 1 &amp; 2 emission intensity — FY24–25</h3><p class="font-normal text-dark-2 text-[16px] leading-[24px] tracking-[-0.32px]">Alongside our RE100 and EV100 memberships, a 90.14% zero waste to landfill achievement, and a steady year-on-year improvement in renewable energy consumption across our operations.</p></article></div><a class="group/viewall flex gap-[2px] items-center relative shrink-0 w-fit" href="/about-us/leadership/"><div class="flex items-center justify-center p-3 sm:p-[16px] rounded-[4px] shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 border border-ever-teal-100 bg-ever-teal-80 text-white group-hover/viewall:bg-ever-teal-100"><span class="font-semibold leading-[16px] text-[12px] sm:text-[14px] tracking-[0.28px] whitespace-nowrap">Explore Our Leadership</span></div><div class="relative size-[40px] shrink-0 overflow-hidden sm:size-[48px]"><img alt="" class="block h-full w-full max-w-none" src="/images/vector23.svg" decoding="async"/><div class="-translate-y-1/2 absolute h-[48px] left-0 right-0 top-1/2 transition-opacity duration-300 bg-ever-teal-100 opacity-0 group-hover/viewall:opacity-100" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(/images/vector23.svg);mask-image:url(/images/vector23.svg);-webkit-mask-size:100% 100%;mask-size:100% 100%;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-repeat:no-repeat"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center"><div class="-translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 absolute left-1/2 size-[24px] top-1/2"><div class="icon-spin size-[24px] shrink-0 origin-center"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="block size-[24px] shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8.63 9.53H0.47L0 10L0.47 10.47H8.63L9.1 10L8.63 9.53Z" class="fill-bold-amber transition-[fill] duration-300 ease-out group-hover/viewall:fill-white"></path><path d="M19.53 9.53H11.37L10.9 10L11.37 10.47H19.53L20 10L19.53 9.53Z" class="fill-ever-teal-100 trans